  "version": "0.21.16",
  "notes": "Playbooks play up to an hour at a time and keep going while they make progress; they stop early when the game cannot go on (energy, timers) so the next game can play.\nPlay now replaces Carry on and always starts at once; Resume schedule starts the next game right away.\nClosing Falcor.Hub pauses the schedule: it opens again on Resume schedule, and games keep their Autopilot.\nToday's Queue: each row leads with its time (NOW / READY), an LED ticker shows the schedule (gold when paused, green when on), and Pause queue is now Pause schedule.\nWord Yatzy is much faster: a whole word in one move, and the green score is placed at once.\nBetter ad exits (TikTok, Whatnot, PuzzlePlay, JustPlay); never Super Hint, never rate, never the mute button, no wheel spins.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T03:57:21.901Z",
